# What the daemon does not need, and must not be sent.
#
# `core/target` alone is nineteen gigabytes on a machine that has built this
# once. Without this file the whole of it is copied to the build daemon before
# the first instruction runs — which is slow enough to look like a hang, and
# is how a container build fills a disk.
core/target
build
.git

# Nothing in these reaches the binary, and some of it should never leave the
# machine at all.
**/*.key
**/devices.json
**/sessions.log
